          "docs": "根據提供的欄位和值搜尋課程。\n- 使用欄位名稱作為查詢參數\n- 例如：/search?chinese_title=產業.+&english_title=..."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Search Courses By Condition",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.nthusa.tw/courses/search",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "進階搜尋，根據條件取得課程。可以使用巢狀條件。"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List Courses By Type",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.nthusa.tw/courses/lists/:list_name",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "list_name",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "取得指定類型的課程列表。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bundled": true
